Guidelime.registerGuide([[
[D Quests for Blackwing Lair \\ https://github.com/JanRK/Guidelime_DungeonQuests]
[N 60 40man Blackwing Lair]
[NX 60 40man Molten Core]

Blackwing Lair sits at the very top of Blackrock Mountain, the volcano between the Searing Gorge and the Burning Steppes. Inside the mountain, climb to the high ledge and take the Spire portal, run through Lower Blackrock Spire into Upper Blackrock Spire, and enter the Lair past General Drakkisath's hall. Upper Blackrock Spire needs the Seal of Ascension from the Upper Blackrock Spire guide.

-- Left out: 8286, 8288 Only One May Rise and 8730 Nefarius's Corruption: steps of the Scepter of the Shifting Sands chain that starts in Silithus, left out by every guide including Ahn'Qiraj (a 30-quest world chain with a reputation grind and the one-time gate event).

-- Horde: Kargath, the Searing Gorge gate, the raid, then Orgrimmar.
[A Horde] Start at Gorrik in Kargath and get the Kargath flight path [P Kargath] [G4.0,44.9 Badlands] \\ The Lower Blackrock Spire guide walks you here from Undercity. The Malevolent Mirage (elite 42) can drift near 5,45.
[A Horde] South out of Kargath and west through the pass into the Searing Gorge [G4.0,44.9 Badlands][G2.0,56.7 Badlands][G80.0,48.2 Searing Gorge] [OC]
[A Horde] West along the road, then south-west to the Blackrock Mountain gate [G57.8,48.8 Searing Gorge][G47.7,65.9 Searing Gorge][G34.9,83.9 Searing Gorge] [OC] \\ Infernus Siege Giants (60) walk the road near 55,53, Lord Gazzran (62) and a Faulty War Golem (rare elite) stand near 45,68, and Obsidian Reavers and Surgers (55-60) guard the gate.

-- Alliance: Morgan's Vigil, the Burning Steppes gate, the raid, then Stormwind.
[A Alliance] Start at Borgus Stoutarm in Morgan's Vigil and get the Morgan's Vigil flight path [P Morgan's Vigil] [G84.3,68.3 Burning Steppes] \\ The Lower Blackrock Spire guide walks you here from Stormwind.
[A Alliance] West along the road to Blackrock Mountain and in by the Burning Steppes gate [G83.3,66.7 Burning Steppes][G75.1,54.4 Burning Steppes][G71.0,48.2 Burning Steppes][G58.7,47.8 Burning Steppes][G46.5,47.7 Burning Steppes][G41.2,49.8 Burning Steppes][G31.6,51.3 Burning Steppes][G21.8,48.8 Burning Steppes][G20.7,47.7 Burning Steppes][G15.4,40.1 Burning Steppes][G15.3,32.4 Burning Steppes] [OC] \\ Flamescale dragonkin (elite, 56-58) stand by the road west of 37,47, Blackrock Ambushers (elite 56) near 33,51, and the rare elites Terrorspark and Thauris Balgarr roam near 51-54,39-43. Gruklash (rare elite 59) can stand by the gate near 15,30, Firesworn (60-61) wander near 15,39 and an Escaped Core Hound (60) near 37,51.

-- Both factions: inside Blackrock Mountain.
Climb the upper path to the ledge with the Blackrock Spire portal. Kill the Scarshield Quartermaster in the hallway outside the portal until he drops Blackhand's Command, which starts [QA7761 Blackhand's Command] \\ Drop source from Dungeon Journal and Wowhead (Wowhead shows Classic Era numbers; unverified on Forever).
In Upper Blackrock Spire, kill General Drakkisath and touch Drakkisath's Brand behind him [QC7761 Blackhand's Command][QT7761 Blackhand's Command] \\ This attunes you: the orb by the Lair's door then lets you in.
Into Blackwing Lair. Kill Nefarian and loot the Head of Nefarian \\ Unverified on Forever: how many heads drop per kill and which faction's head drops.
[A Horde] Right-click the Head of Nefarian to start [QA7783 The Lord of Blackrock]
[A Alliance] Right-click the Head of Nefarian to start [QA7781 The Lord of Blackrock]

-- Horde: Orgrimmar.
[A Horde] Leave Blackrock Mountain by the Searing Gorge gate and walk back to Kargath [G34.9,83.9 Searing Gorge][G47.7,65.9 Searing Gorge][G57.8,48.8 Searing Gorge][G80.0,48.2 Searing Gorge][G2.0,56.7 Badlands][G4.0,44.9 Badlands] [OC]
[A Horde] Fly to Orgrimmar [F Orgrimmar] \\ If your hearthstone is set to Orgrimmar you can hearth instead.
[A Horde] From the Orgrimmar flight master walk to the Valley of Wisdom [G45.3,63.7 Orgrimmar][G31.7,37.8 Orgrimmar] [OC]
[A Horde] Thrall takes [QT7783 The Lord of Blackrock] and gives [QA7784 The Lord of Blackrock] [G31.7,37.8 Orgrimmar]
[A Horde] Through the city to the Valley of Honor [G31.7,37.8 Orgrimmar][G38.5,50.0 Orgrimmar][G47.0,62.9 Orgrimmar][G51.0,75.7 Orgrimmar] [OC]
[A Horde] High Overlord Saurfang takes [QT7784 The Lord of Blackrock] [G51.0,75.7 Orgrimmar] \\ Choose your reward.

-- Alliance: Stormwind.
[A Alliance] Leave Blackrock Mountain by the Burning Steppes gate and walk back to Morgan's Vigil [G46.5,47.7 Burning Steppes][G58.7,47.8 Burning Steppes][G71.0,48.2 Burning Steppes][G75.1,54.4 Burning Steppes][G83.3,66.7 Burning Steppes][G84.3,68.3 Burning Steppes] [OC]
[A Alliance] Fly to Stormwind [F Stormwind] \\ If your hearthstone is set to Stormwind you can hearth instead.
[A Alliance] From the Stormwind flight master walk to Stormwind Keep [G71.6,72.3 Stormwind City][G80.2,38.4 Stormwind City] [OC]
[A Alliance] Highlord Bolvar Fordragon takes [QT7781 The Lord of Blackrock] and gives [QA7782 The Lord of Blackrock] [G80.2,38.4 Stormwind City]
[A Alliance] Out of the keep and south through the city to Field Marshal Stonebridge by the main gate [G80.2,38.4 Stormwind City][G76.1,59.8 Stormwind City][G74.7,70.1 Stormwind City][G72.5,73.5 Stormwind City][G71.0,74.5 Stormwind City][G69.5,76.5 Stormwind City][G68.5,79.5 Stormwind City][G71.5,80.5 Stormwind City] [OC] \\ A Sewer Beast (elite 50) can roam the canals near 71,68.
[A Alliance] Field Marshal Stonebridge takes [QT7782 The Lord of Blackrock] [G71.5,80.5 Stormwind City] \\ Choose your reward.
